              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’ba azini eceta dria ecepi erileni yo, tali osutaru dria ’diyi pie, Yehovani ani eri ti pezu ’yezu angu Misiriari ma alia, Farau pi ma ruaa, ati’ba erini be, angu erini ma alia dria, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
